> or/and point me to the location of the main datafields.

1)  Use the AUTHORIZE command LIST/FULL to get a full
    listing and look in that file.

2)  Use SYS$IDTOASC and SYS$GETUAI to get the information
    from a program.

    There is an example at ftp://ftp.hhs.dk/pub/vms/misc/uafchk.pas !

3)  Read directly from the UAF via definitions from UAFDEF.

    There are an example at
ftp://ftp.hhs.dk/pub/vms/utilities/utilities.zip !

