>>> isacfg -init
>>> init
>>> ewrk3_config -curaddr 300 -default
<power cycle>
>>> add_de205
>>> init

should work. There may still be conflicts with irq-values or something,
but those commands should warn if irq is illegal...
If you can show us device config (sho conf) and eeprom contents 
(ewrk3_config -curaddr 300 -show) at different stages then someone
might get an idea whats wrong...                                       /OK



