MOP DL aa:0:4:0:1:dc     > 8:0:2b:d:b2:f   len 1006 code 02 MLD
MOP DL 8:0:2b:d:b2:f   > aa:0:4:0:1:dc     len    3 code 0a RML
MOP DL aa:0:4:0:1:dc     > 8:0:2b:d:b2:f   len 1006 code 02 MLD
MOP DL 8:0:2b:d:b2:f   > aa:0:4:0:1:dc     len    3 code 0a RML
