I'm pretty certain that the Venturis FX BIOS is limited to 8.4GB
maximum.  There are two choices to get the full capacity of the drive:

1. Get a BIOS-only add-in card or even an ATA-33 or ATA-66 disk
controller card, such as made by Promise, SIIG, GSI, and others.

2. Use the so-called drive overlay software provided by the
mnaufacturer of the hard drive.

An add-in card is preferable due to fewer long-term problems.

... Ben Myers

