after 10 seconds again. i thought the power supply was on the fritz, but
the other drives would still stay powered on when i tried them. i've
looked all over the vax pages i could find, printed off all the
technical information i found, but i am completely stumped. any
help/info would be soothing at this point..

a vax enthusiast (if i ever get to use the unit),
harry doyle




