After the self-test sequence completes, type 'T 50' at the '>>>' prompt
and post the output here.  You will likely have to hand copy this output
unless you have some sort of terminal emulation being used on the console
port.

You might also try the format commands at the '>>>' prompt.  However, I'd
advise against that until it's determined that there is no problem with
the unit's controller, etc.

You might also try the system exerciser.  '>>> T 0' or '>>> B PRA0' and
then, issue the '>>> T 50' to get the system status.

--
