I thought that several years ago DEC changed the licensing policy to make all
licenses (except, I think, the base system license) non-node specific. A
given system needed so many units of license and as long as you had enough
units you were all set. So if you have a VMScluster license you should be
able to use that license with any system you connect to the cluster as
long as your total units is enough for all nodes/systems in the cluster.

